{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01ETCzLiW9WQ3ktHNdQyba4N", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://azbyka.ru/maslenica-maxsimov\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.booksite.ru/localtxt/enc/ikl/ope/diya/enciklopedya_obryad/12.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://shkola10efremov-r71.gosweb.gosuslugi.ru/netcat_files/userfiles/Timofeeva/urok_Maslenitsa.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.svoboda.org/a/378768.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mel.fm/blog/oksana-anshukova/31590-ritualnyye-draki-obzhorstvo-pro-zapas-i-drugiye-maslenichnyye-traditsii-o-kotorykh-vy-ne-znali\"}, {\"url\": \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1M_TQMpLq7_uKL_8Ea_H0P11YXbaLlrE5/export?format=pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mari-el.gov.ru/upload/medialibrary/0d0/wc8yy4joqhxrx9p6agqhcj302fb29pq8.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://shkola10efremov-r71.gosweb.gosuslugi.ru/netcat_files/userfiles/Timofeeva/maslenitsa.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://360.ru/news/obschestvo/tretij-den-maslenicy--lakomka-12980/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:39:35.179Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "rodnayaladoga Масленица молодые в лучших нарядах выстраивались вдоль улицы просили поцеловаться обряд назывался", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_014KSM67coxRXz3ThHNchnCy", "content": [{"title": "С.В. Максимов", "url": "https://azbyka.ru/maslenica-maxsimov"}, {"title": "www.booksite.ru", "url": "https://www.booksite.ru/localtxt/enc/ikl/ope/diya/enciklopedya_obryad/12.htm"}, {"title": "urok Maslenitsa", "url": "https://shkola10efremov-r71.gosweb.gosuslugi.ru/netcat_files/userfiles/Timofeeva/urok_Maslenitsa.pdf"}, {"title": "Ссылки для упрощенного доступа", "url": "https://www.svoboda.org/a/378768.html"}, {"title": "Ритуальные драки, обжорство про запас и другие масленичные традиции, о которых вы не знали", "url": "https://mel.fm/blog/oksana-anshukova/31590-ritualnyye-draki-obzhorstvo-pro-zapas-i-drugiye-maslenichnyye-traditsii-o-kotorykh-vy-ne-znali"}, {"title": "docs.google.com", "url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1M_TQMpLq7_uKL_8Ea_H0P11YXbaLlrE5/export?format=pdf"}, {"title": "mari-el.gov.ru", "url": "https://mari-el.gov.ru/upload/medialibrary/0d0/wc8yy4joqhxrx9p6agqhcj302fb29pq8.pdf"}, {"title": "gosuslugi.ru", "url": "https://shkola10efremov-r71.gosweb.gosuslugi.ru/netcat_files/userfiles/Timofeeva/maslenitsa.pdf"}, {"title": "Третий день Масленицы. Лакомка", "url": "https://360.ru/news/obschestvo/tretij-den-maslenicy--lakomka-12980/"}]}, "The search didn't find the passage you're looking for, so I can't confirm the name of the rite. None of the results describe young people lining a street to be kissed.\n\nThe closest result is an encyclopedia entry on Maslenitsa customs. It says that many Maslenitsa customs aimed to help unmarried young people find a partner, and it gives a Kostroma example in which a harrow was dragged along the houses so the girls could more easily come out to meet the young men. Many customs were designed to speed up weddings and help unmarried young people find a partner. That is a matchmaking custom, not a kissing rite.\n\nTo pin down the name, try searching for \"поцелуйные обряды Масленица\" or \"целовальные игры Масленица\". The source you're thinking of may be a regional ethnographic text, which would be worth checking directly."], "durationSeconds": 6.549172749999998, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01ETCzLiW9WQ3ktHNdQyba4N", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
